2026-10-09T01:07:06.8600740Z         - text: 官方 · 原文
2026-10-09T01:07:06.8601305Z         - paragraph: EPF International Office supports students in finding accommodation options, including residence halls, private rooms, or apartments.
2026-10-09T01:07:06.8601435Z         - group: 資料來源
2026-10-09T01:07:06.8601553Z         - text: 官方 · 原文
2026-10-09T01:07:06.8602349Z         - paragraph: Afin de faciliter votre arrivée en France, l’EPF accompagne les étudiants internationaux dans leur recherche de logement, dès l’admission et avant le début des cours.
2026-10-09T01:07:06.8602474Z         - group: 資料來源
2026-10-09T01:07:06.8602611Z         - group: 再看 1 則資料
2026-10-09T01:07:06.8602731Z         - text: AI 推論
2026-10-09T01:07:06.8602915Z         - paragraph: 先確認交換生住宿資格，再把交通與餐食納入預算。
2026-10-09T01:07:06.8603045Z         - group: 推論依據
2026-10-09T01:07:06.8603163Z         - group: 繼續查詢
2026-10-09T01:07:06.8603248Z       - article:
2026-10-09T01:07:06.8603407Z         - heading "每月生活預算" [level=3]
2026-10-09T01:07:06.8603535Z         - text: 官方 · 機器翻譯
2026-10-09T01:07:06.8604278Z         - paragraph: EPF 交換頁沒有公布可跨三個交換校區套用的現行交換生月預算或住宿定價。官方 工程師法語 頁列出的住宿 EUR 1,499／6 週、EUR 1,069／4 週及 EUR 440 押金，只適用 2026 暑期法語工程師課程，不能拿來估算一般學期交換住宿。特魯瓦 校區頁列有 CROUS 午餐 EUR 3.30；其他生活與交通成本仍須依錄取校區及當期住房方案另查。
2026-10-09T01:07:06.8604398Z         - group: 資料來源
2026-10-09T01:07:06.8604515Z         - group: 繼續查詢
2026-10-09T01:07:06.8604596Z       - article:
2026-10-09T01:07:06.8604754Z         - heading "飲食與採買" [level=3]
2026-10-09T01:07:06.8604873Z         - text: 官方 · 原文
2026-10-09T01:07:06.8605254Z         - paragraph: The shopping streets in the city centre offer a range of restaurants, supermarkets and shops.
2026-10-09T01:07:06.8605386Z         - group: 資料來源
2026-10-09T01:07:06.8605500Z         - text: AI 推論
2026-10-09T01:07:06.8605699Z         - paragraph: 可將這些地點列為用餐與採買候選，再比對上課校區及宿舍位置。
2026-10-09T01:07:06.8605829Z         - group: 推論依據
2026-10-09T01:07:06.8605940Z         - group: 繼續查詢
2026-10-09T01:07:06.8606025Z       - article:
2026-10-09T01:07:06.8606178Z         - heading "交通與地點" [level=3]
2026-10-09T01:07:06.8606298Z         - text: 官方 · 原文
2026-10-09T01:07:06.8606851Z         - paragraph: Located just a few minutes away from Paris by public transport , Cachan offers all the advantages of the city without any of the drawbacks!
2026-10-09T01:07:06.8606970Z         - group: 資料來源
2026-10-09T01:07:06.8607076Z         - text: 官方
2026-10-09T01:07:06.8607858Z         - paragraph: 交換課程分布在 Cachan、Montpellier 與 Troyes，必須先依錄取課程確認校區，不能跨校區套用交通資訊。Troyes 校區頁標示市中心搭 6 或 8 號公車約 30 分鐘、騎車約 15 分鐘，週一至週四晚間有接駁服務至 22:00；這些只適用 Troyes，其他校區須另查。
2026-10-09T01:07:06.8608141Z         - group: 資料來源
2026-10-09T01:07:06.8608257Z         - text: AI 推論
2026-10-09T01:07:06.8608484Z         - paragraph: 可比較住宿到上述站點的路線，評估通勤選擇。
2026-10-09T01:07:06.8608605Z         - group: 推論依據
2026-10-09T01:07:06.8608843Z         - group: 繼續查詢
2026-10-09T01:07:06.8608930Z       - article:
2026-10-09T01:07:06.8609086Z         - heading "課業與教學" [level=3]
2026-10-09T01:07:06.8609207Z         - text: 官方 · 原文
2026-10-09T01:07:06.8609911Z         - paragraph: It offers 16,000m² of ultra-modern facilities and cutting-edge innovation and research laboratories to support excellence in teaching and research.
2026-10-09T01:07:06.8610032Z         - group: 資料來源
2026-10-09T01:07:06.8610146Z         - group: 繼續查詢
2026-10-09T01:07:06.8610232Z       - article:
2026-10-09T01:07:06.8610389Z         - heading "校園活動與社交" [level=3]
2026-10-09T01:07:06.8610510Z         - text: 官方 · 原文
2026-10-09T01:07:06.8611135Z         - paragraph: "Sport enthusiasts have not been left out: they will have the opportunity to let off some steam at the numerous sports facilities (gyms, swimming pool, clubs)."
2026-10-09T01:07:06.8611262Z         - group: 資料來源
2026-10-09T01:07:06.8611384Z         - text: 官方 · 機器翻譯
2026-10-09T01:07:06.8612316Z         - paragraph: EPF 交換生秋季只開放五年級課程、春季只開放四年級課程，一至三年級不開放。卡尚 的 Aeronautics & Space、結構與材料、工程與數位技術、工程管理 為全法語，工程與健康 約半數英語；蒙彼利埃 的 能源與環境 約半數英語、數據工程 全英語；特魯瓦 的 建築與生態城市 為全法語。法語課須 B1、英語課須 B2，每學期須修 20 至 30 ECTS；公開收件日為秋季 4 月 30 日、春季 10 月 30 日，仍須先通過長庚提名與當期名額確認。
2026-10-09T01:07:06.8612439Z         - group: 資料來源
2026-10-09T01:07:06.8612552Z         - group: 繼續查詢
2026-10-09T01:07:06.8612636Z       - article:
2026-10-09T01:07:06.8612792Z         - heading "文化適應與交朋友" [level=3]
2026-10-09T01:07:06.8612911Z         - text: 官方 · 原文
2026-10-09T01:07:06.8613456Z         - paragraph: This town of 30,000 inhabitants has been able to develop a way of life that combines green spaces , a range of services and a cultural life .
2026-10-09T01:07:06.8613572Z         - group: 資料來源
2026-10-09T01:07:06.8613691Z         - text: 官方 · 原文
2026-10-09T01:07:06.8614157Z         - paragraph: By integrating women into science and technology, it anticipated the essential role of diversity in innovation.
