2026-10-09T01:07:06.8653748Z         - text: 官方 · 原文
2026-10-09T01:07:06.8654455Z         - paragraph: It offers a high quality of life, a lively cultural calendar, plenty of cafés and restaurants, and easy access to Brittany’s coastline and countryside.
