2026-10-09T01:07:06.8656120Z         - text: 官方 · 原文
2026-10-09T01:07:06.8656686Z         - paragraph: The Paris campus is located at 9 rue d’Athènes, 75009 Paris , in the heart of the capital, close to Saint-Lazare station.
