2026-10-09T01:07:06.8656921Z         - text: 官方 · 原文
2026-10-09T01:07:06.8658025Z         - paragraph: "The campus is also well connected to Rennes city centre via the STAR public transport network : Pontchaillou metro station is approximately a 10-minute walk away, with bus routes and cycle paths also easily accessible."
